<title>PORTUGAL: Nordic Investment launches 5.0 bln esc bond.</title>
<headline>Nordic Investment launches 5.0 bln esc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nordic Investment Bank (NIB) is launching a five billion escudo, seven-year 'Navigator' bond offering a guaranteed yield of between 6.25 and nine percent, joint lead managers and bookrunners Citibank Portugal and Banco Cisf said.</p>
<p>The issue will be indexed to the six-month Lisbor rate.</p>
<p>NIB specialises in financing investment projects in the Nordic countries.  </p>
<p>BORROWER Nordic Investment Bank  AMT 5.0 billion esc</p>
<p>COUPON Six-month Lisbor (Min 6.25, Max 9.0)</p>
<p>    MATURITY 7 years  TYPE MTN	  ISS PRICE 100</p>
<p>PAY DATE 16/10/96 LAST MOODY Aaa  PAY FREQ Six mths</p>
<p>    LAST S&amp;P AAA	LISTING  Lux    DENOMS (K)</p>
<p>GOV LAW  Eng</p>
<p>--Sergio Goncalves, Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
